<title>UK: Saudi cuts April Berri 20 cts to Europe-trade.</title>
<headline>Saudi cuts April Berri 20 cts to Europe-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabia cut the price of its Berri Extra Light crude by 20 cents a barrel for European customers in April, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>This takes Berri down to Dated Brent -$1.10 a barrel from Dated Brent -$0.90 in March.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
